---
title: "publishRaisedCapital (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: Legion operator calls publishRaisedCapital(capitalAmount)
    q_check_auth --> q_error_auth: caller is not Legion operator
    q_error_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_ended --> q_error_ended: hasEnded == false
    q_error_ended --> [*]: revert SaleNotEnded
    q_check_ended --> q_check_refund: hasEnded == true
    q_check_refund --> q_error_refund: block.timestamp < refundEndTime
    q_error_refund --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodActive
    q_check_refund --> q_check_published: block.timestamp >= refundEndTime
    q_check_published --> q_error_published: capitalAlreadyPublished == true
    q_error_published --> [*]: revert CapitalAlreadyPublished
    q_check_published --> q_publish: capitalAlreadyPublished == false
    q_publish --> q_emit: totalRaisedCapital = capitalAmount, capitalAlreadyPublished = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit RaisedCapitalPublished(capitalAmount)

    note right of q_check_refund
        INV-001: Capital can only be published after refund period expires
        INV-002: Capital publication happens exactly once
        INV-003: totalRaisedCapital <= totalCapitalInvested (after refunds)
    end note
